# Release build output
/dist/

# Module-signing key material — NEVER commit. Lives in ~/.mok on the box and is
# backed up in 1Password; these patterns are defense-in-depth in case any key
# material is ever copied into the tree.
*.priv
*.key
*.pem
*.der
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
MOK*
mok*
*_mok*
signing_key*
